    - `(self)`
    - `(self, info: SerializationInfo)`

    And two other signatures for `mode='wrap'`:

    - `(self, nxt: SerializerFunctionWrapHandler)`
    - `(self, nxt: SerializerFunctionWrapHandler, info: SerializationInfo)`

